000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PERFTEST.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01  TBL.
000600     05  ENT OCCURS 5 TIMES.
000700         10  ENT-YEAR PIC S9(4) COMP.
000800 01  WS-IDX   PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
000900 01  WS-TOT   PIC S9(7) COMP VALUE 0.
001000 01  WS-CNT   PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
001100 01  EOF-FLAG PIC X VALUE 'N'.
001200     88  AT-EOF VALUE 'Y'.
001300 01  OUT-NUM  PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
001400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001500 MAIN-PARA.
001600     PERFORM FILL-PARA THRU FILL-EXIT
001700         VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > 5.
001800     MOVE WS-IDX TO OUT-NUM.
001900     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
002000     MOVE 0 TO WS-TOT.
002100     MOVE 1 TO WS-IDX.
002200     PERFORM SUM-PARA THRU SUM-EXIT
002300         UNTIL WS-IDX > 5 OR ENT-YEAR (WS-IDX) > 3.
002400     MOVE WS-TOT TO OUT-NUM.
002500     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
002600     MOVE 0 TO WS-CNT.
002700     PERFORM EOF-PARA THRU EOF-EXIT UNTIL AT-EOF.
002800     MOVE WS-CNT TO OUT-NUM.
002900     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
003000     MOVE 0 TO WS-CNT.
003100     PERFORM BUMP-PARA THRU BUMP-EXIT 4 TIMES.
003200     MOVE WS-CNT TO OUT-NUM.
003300     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
003400     MOVE 0 TO WS-CNT.
003500     PERFORM BUMP-PARA THRU BUMP-EXIT UNTIL WS-CNT = 0.
003600     MOVE WS-CNT TO OUT-NUM.
003700     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
003800     STOP RUN.
003900 FILL-PARA.
004000     MOVE WS-IDX TO ENT-YEAR (WS-IDX).
004100 FILL-EXIT.
004200     EXIT.
004300 SUM-PARA.
004400     ADD ENT-YEAR (WS-IDX) TO WS-TOT.
004500     ADD 1 TO WS-IDX.
004600 SUM-EXIT.
004700     EXIT.
004800 EOF-PARA.
004900     ADD 1 TO WS-CNT.
005000     IF WS-CNT > 2 MOVE 'Y' TO EOF-FLAG.
005100 EOF-EXIT.
005200     EXIT.
005300 BUMP-PARA.
005400     ADD 1 TO WS-CNT.
005500 BUMP-EXIT.
005600     EXIT.
